<title>USA: Photran Corp Q3 net rises, EPS flat.</title>
<headline>Photran Corp Q3 net rises, EPS flat.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended Sept. 30</p>
<p>							  1996	  1995</p>
<p> Total Revenues(1)			  $2,071,055   $1,438,203</p>
<p> Gross Profit				    454,341	401,347</p>
<p> Operating Income/(Loss)		     107,280	197,609</p>
<p> Net Income/(Loss)			     184,929	105,252</p>
<p> Net Income/(Loss) per share		    0.03	   0.03</p>
<p> Avg Shares				    5,502,419    3,346,194</p>
<p>					     Nine Months Ended Sept. 30</p>
<p>							 1996	   1995</p>
<p> Total Revenues			     $4,862,105   $2,107,146</p>
<p> Gross Profit				  1,333,109	526,584</p>
<p> Operating Income/(Loss)		     356,229     (98,071)</p>
<p> Net Income/(Loss)			     391,099    (268,712)</p>
<p> Net Income/(Loss) per share		    0.09	 (0.08)</p>
<p> Avg Shares				    4,297,606    3,346,194</p>
<p>(1) Revenues for the third quarter of 1996 and for the nine month period ended September 30, 1996 include $1,140,000 and $2,050,000, respectively, related to the sale of equipment and technology to the company's largest customer.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
